      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMIC BANJO (5) turned in a plain effort last time when eighth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Devenish Devil (23.00) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Better than last start and worth following up. TUTA BAM BAM (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (16.69) there the start prior. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Can do much better this time. TRUSTFUL (7) jumps from box 7 for the first time after placing latest at this track (16.75) in a Grade 5. Expected to be in this for a long way. SPICY VIKING (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
